{"body": "Implements all_entries metadata table - #1053\nThis is my initial pr towards supporting all_entries in pyiceberg , i'm currently running into an issue where the number of entries returned by spark is less then what pyiceberg returns and i'm not sure why\npyiceberg results:\n\nspark results:\n\nIm also attaching the csv for investigation puporses\npy_iceberg vs spark.csv\n*Update - issue resolved", "date": "2025-02-04T17:10:57Z", "hash": "sha256:6e31e9e28c4c8838c76a", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg-python#1608", "meta": {"additions": 564, "association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "base": "main", "closed_at": "2026-03-25T00:29:44Z", "comments": 20, "deletions": 59, "draft": false, "files": ["mkdocs/docs/api.md", "pyiceberg/table/inspect.py", "tests/integration/test_inspect_table.py"], "labels": ["stale"], "last_commit": "2025-05-15T16:42:12Z", "n_files": 3, "number": 1608, "repo": "apache/iceberg-python", "reviews": [{"at": "2025-02-08T18:04:07Z", "by": "kevinjqliu", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2025-02-16T21:32:19Z", "by": "kevinjqliu", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2025-02-17T20:32:14Z", "by": "amitgilad3", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2025-06-29T16:45:16Z", "by": "jayceslesar", "state": "COMMENTED"}], "state": "closed", "thumbs_up": 0, "updated_at": "2026-03-25T00:29:44Z"}, "people": ["amitgilad3"], "refs": ["gh:apache/iceberg-python#1053"], "source": "github", "title": "support all_entries in pyiceberg", "type": "pr", "url": "https://github.com/apache/iceberg-python/pull/1608"}
