{"body": "Related to #1238\nHowever, there was a lot of info in there that didn't seem relevant to the custom file-io configuration, so I just kept the introductory statement and added a (partial) sample implementation that doesn't describe the RelativeInputFile and RelativeOutputFile implementations.  Let me know if I can make this better. Thanks!", "date": "2025-02-10T14:58:49Z", "hash": "sha256:fd949c0fb764ebd6981d", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg-python#1635", "meta": {"additions": 49, "association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "base": "main", "closed_at": "2026-03-25T00:29:48Z", "comments": 3, "deletions": 0, "draft": false, "files": ["mkdocs/docs/configuration.md"], "labels": ["stale"], "last_commit": "2025-02-10T14:54:52Z", "n_files": 1, "number": 1635, "repo": "apache/iceberg-python", "reviews": [{"at": "2025-02-12T18:45:21Z", "by": "Fokko", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2025-02-13T16:36:52Z", "by": "summermousa-vendia", "state": "COMMENTED"}], "state": "closed", "thumbs_up": 0, "updated_at": "2026-03-25T00:29:48Z"}, "people": ["summermousa-vendia"], "refs": ["gh:apache/iceberg-python#1238"], "source": "github", "title": "Add file-io specific documentation", "type": "pr", "url": "https://github.com/apache/iceberg-python/pull/1635"}
{"body": "Adding support for writing metadata to a custom path set via write.metadata.path property. Since the Python library consolidates the table operation classes in both the table and catalog classes, I had to surface the metadata file location handling to the base Catalog class to avoid circular dependencies. This way we are also able to centralize the metadata location handling for table metadata and snapshots.\nRelates to #1492", "date": "2025-02-11T07:02:11Z", "hash": "sha256:b5e0d4392fdc75a80d7c", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg-python#1642", "meta": {"additions": 158, "association": "MEMBER", "base": "main", "closed_at": "2025-02-14T17:35:32Z", "comments": 15, "deletions": 30, "draft": false, "files": ["mkdocs/docs/configuration.md", "pyiceberg/catalog/__init__.py", "pyiceberg/catalog/dynamodb.py", "pyiceberg/catalog/sql.py", "pyiceberg/table/__init__.py", "pyiceberg/table/locations.py", "pyiceberg/table/update/snapshot.py", "tests/catalog/test_base.py", "tests/table/test_locations.py"], "last_commit": "2025-02-14T17:13:46Z", "merged_at": "2025-02-14T17:35:32Z", "merged_by": "kevinjqliu", "milestone": "PyIceberg 0.9.0", "n_files": 9, "number": 1642, "repo": "apache/iceberg-python", "reviews": [{"at": "2025-02-11T16:36:47Z", "by": "kevinjqliu", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2025-02-11T22:30:21Z", "by": "kevinjqliu", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2025-02-11T22:40:45Z", "by": "kevinjqliu", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2025-02-12T04:52:34Z", "by": "kevinjqliu", "state": "APPROVED"}, {"at": "2025-02-12T18:30:40Z", "by": "Fokko", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2025-02-12T19:11:51Z", "by": "kevinjqliu", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2025-02-12T20:34:11Z", "by": "Fokko", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2025-02-12T20:53:43Z", "by": "geruh", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2025-02-13T14:59:10Z", "by": "smaheshwar-pltr", "state": "COMMENTED"}, {"at": "2025-02-13T18:30:20Z", "by": "kevinjqliu", "state": "APPROVED"}, {"at": "2025-02-13T18:42:17Z", "by": "smaheshwar-pltr",