{"body": "This is an initial implementation of rewrite manifests, aiming to mimic the Java implementation as closely as possible. I’ve tried to follow the same structure and logic, but there are still some areas that might need refinement.\nI’m looking for feedback and suggestions on:\n•\tWhether the approach aligns well with the existing design.\n•\tAny gaps or optimizations that could improve performance.\n•\tHow best to proceed with completing this feature.\nWould love any insights or guidance on the next steps! Thanks in advance for the review! 🙌", "date": "2025-02-13T20:21:24Z", "hash": "sha256:fe37af81c47edaea5f55", "id": "gh:apache/iceberg-python#1661", "meta": {"additions": 6231, "association": "CONTRIBUTOR", "base": "main", "closed_at": "2026-03-25T00:29:53Z", "comments": 28, "deletions": 2950, "draft": false, "files": [".github/workflows/pypi-build-artifacts.yml", ".github/workflows/python-ci.yml", ".github/workflows/svn-build-artifacts.yml", ".gitignore", ".pre-commit-config.yaml", "Makefile", "dev/Dockerfile", "dev/docker-compose-integration.yml", "dev/docker-compose.yml", "dev/hive/core-site.xml", "dev/provision.py", "mkdocs/docs/SUMMARY.md", "mkdocs/docs/api.md", "mkdocs/docs/cli.md", "mkdocs/docs/configuration.md", "mkdocs/docs/expression-dsl.md", "mkdocs/docs/row-filter-syntax.md", "poetry.lock", "pyiceberg/avro/codecs/__init__.py", "pyiceberg/avro/codecs/zstandard_codec.py", "pyiceberg/avro/file.py", "pyiceberg/catalog/__init__.py", "pyiceberg/catalog/dynamodb.py", "pyiceberg/catalog/glue.py", "pyiceberg/catalog/hive.py", "pyiceberg/catalog/memory.py", "pyiceberg/catalog/rest/__init__.py", "pyiceberg/catalog/rest/auth.py", "pyiceberg/catalog/rest/response.py", "pyiceberg/catalog/sql.py", "pyiceberg/cli/console.py", "pyiceberg/expressions/literals.py", "pyiceberg/io/__init__.py", "pyiceberg/io/fsspec.py", "pyiceberg/io/pyarrow.py", "pyiceberg/manifest.py", "pyiceberg/schema.py", "pyiceberg/table/__init__.py", "pyiceberg/table/inspect.py", "pyiceberg/